{"id":"970e2b8779070da0","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md","title":"Natural Transformation","display":"df-natural-transformation — Natural Transformation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-natural-transformation","aliases":["58-df-natural-transformation","58-df-zfc-cat-natural-transformation"],"display":"df-natural-transformation — Natural Transformation","depends_on":["[[58-df-functor]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-natural-transformation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-natural-transformation</span><span>58-df-zfc-cat-natural-transformation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-natural-transformation — Natural Transformation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"58-df-functor\">58-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D,F,G,\\eta\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D,F,G,\\eta\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcCatNaturalTransformation}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcCatNaturalTransformation}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}natural\\text{-}transformation}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,F,G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},\\circ_{\\mathcal C},e_{\\mathcal C},\nD_0,D_1,s_{\\mathcal D},t_{\\mathcal D},\\circ_{\\mathcal D},e_{\\mathcal D},\nF_0,F_1,G_0,G_1\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},\\circ_{\\mathcal C},e_{\\mathcal C}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathcal D=\\langle D_0,D_1,s_{\\mathcal D},t_{\\mathcal D},\\circ_{\\mathcal D},e_{\\mathcal D}\\rangle\n\\land F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\land G=\\langle G_0,G_1\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal D)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\eta,C_0,D_1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in C_0\\;\n\\bigl(s_{\\mathcal D}(\\eta(X))=F_0(X)\\land t_{\\mathcal D}(\\eta(X))=G_0(X)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in C_1\\;\n\\bigl(G_1(f)\\circ_{\\mathcal D}\\eta(s_{\\mathcal C}(f))\n=\\eta(t_{\\mathcal C}(f))\\circ_{\\mathcal D}F_1(f)\\bigr)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}natural\\text{-}transformation}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,F,G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},\\circ_{\\mathcal C},e_{\\mathcal C},\nD_0,D_1,s_{\\mathcal D},t_{\\mathcal D},\\circ_{\\mathcal D},e_{\\mathcal D},\nF_0,F_1,G_0,G_1\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},\\circ_{\\mathcal C},e_{\\mathcal C}\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathcal D=\\langle D_0,D_1,s_{\\mathcal D},t_{\\mathcal D},\\circ_{\\mathcal D},e_{\\mathcal D}\\rangle\n\\land F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\land G=\\langle G_0,G_1\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal D)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\eta,C_0,D_1)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in C_0\\;\n\\bigl(s_{\\mathcal D}(\\eta(X))=F_0(X)\\land t_{\\mathcal D}(\\eta(X))=G_0(X)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in C_1\\;\n\\bigl(G_1(f)\\circ_{\\mathcal D}\\eta(s_{\\mathcal C}(f))\n=\\eta(t_{\\mathcal C}(f))\\circ_{\\mathcal D}F_1(f)\\bigr)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}natural\\text{-}transformation\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCatNaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,F,G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,F,G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}natural\\text{-}transformation\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCatNaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,F,G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,F,G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Natural transformations give morphisms between functors.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-cat-natural-transformation</code> is merged here.</li>\n<li>They form the 2-cells of category theory.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D,F,G,\\eta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcCatNaturalTransformation}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}natural\\text{-}transformation}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,F,G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},\\circ_{\\mathcal C},e_{\\mathcal C},\nD_0,D_1,s_{\\mathcal D},t_{\\mathcal D},\\circ_{\\mathcal D},e_{\\mathcal D},\nF_0,F_1,G_0,G_1\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_{\\mathcal C},t_{\\mathcal C},\\circ_{\\mathcal C},e_{\\mathcal C}\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land\\mathcal D=\\langle D_0,D_1,s_{\\mathcal D},t_{\\mathcal D},\\circ_{\\mathcal D},e_{\\mathcal D}\\rangle\n\\land F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\land G=\\langle G_0,G_1\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal D)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\eta,C_0,D_1)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall X\\in C_0\\;\n\\bigl(s_{\\mathcal D}(\\eta(X))=F_0(X)\\land t_{\\mathcal D}(\\eta(X))=G_0(X)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall f\\in C_1\\;\n\\bigl(G_1(f)\\circ_{\\mathcal D}\\eta(s_{\\mathcal C}(f))\n=\\eta(t_{\\mathcal C}(f))\\circ_{\\mathcal D}F_1(f)\\bigr)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}natural\\text{-}transformation\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCatNaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,F,G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,F,G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)","display":true}],"bytes":2145,"backlinks":[{"id":"08f4a3081239a349","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md]])"},{"id":"9a02fd87820572ba","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"$\\epsilon:T\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Id}_{\\mathcal C}$ (counit candidate, see [[../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md]])"},{"id":"dfa5042443233c40","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1f5113ef45d8213e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7200e183a0335a63","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S$ (natural-transformation predicate, see [[../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md]])"},{"id":"61daa6066fb2ea14","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S$ (natural-transformation predicate, see [[58-df-natural-transformation]])"},{"id":"0407a62a7ce39e04","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCatNaturalTransformation}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (natural-transformation predicate, see [[../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md]])"},{"id":"d71c15e0342b2318","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S\\subseteq V^5$（see [[../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md]]）"},{"id":"d8fff134618bbd5c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}$ 取 [[../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"79f72f51c5df5713","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}$ 取 [[../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"e200883e5728e41f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ca227784015c4bc0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3f3e7eea5614d92a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"39ceaa238375b998","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-872","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md|58-df-natural-transformation]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["877f1061e295cf5f","36d7463d215be751","a87b7e1119b63b2c"]}